# Python bytecode and test caches. Regenerated on every run, never source.
# Python lives all over this tree -- 112 files directly in scripts/, plus
# scripts/stage5, stance-news, wa-sweep, federal-bills, gold-desk and several
# data/seed-* directories -- so these are deliberately unanchored and match at
# any depth. Untracked bytecode is what makes `check:deletable` refuse to
# retire a finished worktree.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
